# Allowlist: the build needs the package, the TUI's, their metadata, and
# the entrypoint.
# Everything else -- .git, tests, the venv, a local .env or config.toml --
# stays out of the build context, so no credential can reach a layer.
*
!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!mailctl/
!clients/tui/pyproject.toml
!clients/tui/README.md
!clients/tui/src/
!docker/entrypoint.sh
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
